## Challenges we ran into
- **Infinite fix loops:** the model sometimes repeated the same failed fix. We added a limit on attempts and fed the full error history back into each prompt.
- **Safe execution:** running AI-written code is risky, so we had to isolate it properly in a sandbox.
- **Noisy error output:** long stack traces overloaded the prompt, so we trimmed them down to the most useful lines.
